#: xmodule/course_block.py:1056
msgid "Select Course Font Family"
msgstr "Roghnaigh Teaghlach Clónna Cúrsa"

#: xmodule/course_block.py:1058
msgid ""
"\n"
"            Select course family in which you want to display your course.\n"
"            Available options are \"font-trebuchet\", \"font-open-sans\", \"font-noto-kufi-arabic\", \"font-montserrat\", and \"font-source-sans-pro\".\n"
"            If value is invalid or empty the default font-family will be \"Helvetica Neue\".\n"
"            "
msgstr ""
"\n"
"            Roghnaigh an teaghlach cúrsa inar mian leat do chúrsa a thaispeáint.\n"
"            Is iad na roghanna atá ar fáil ná \"font-trebuchet\", \"font-open-sans\", \"font-noto-kufi-arabic\", \"font-montserrat\", agus \"font-source-sans-pro\".\n"
"            Mura bhfuil an luach bailí nó folamh, is é \"Helvetica Neue\" an teaghlach cló réamhshocraithe.\n"
"            "

